<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney International tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, first round:</p>
<p>Mary Pierce (France) beat 5-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-3 4-6 6-4 Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Nicole Bradtke 6-3 3-6 6-0.</p>
</text>
